{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30935","headline":"长信宫 · 孟迟","name":"长信宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君恩已尽欲何归，犹有残香在舞衣。\n自恨身轻不如燕，春来还遶御帘飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟迟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「长信宫」条，撰者梅　红、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"梅 红"}